    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/2be77c7664c1339b5912f73d74721335.avif?t=1728527361\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Subreddit</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/1b4d2137f95c41ebb7c47b0bec5d7617.avif?t=1728527361\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.poster.avif?t=1728527361\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.webm?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.mp4?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failure at both love and career, Jun-Ho takes a bite of his 33rd birthday cake \u2013 and finds himself transported ten years into the past. This time around, can he get things right with at least one ex-girlfriend? Romance each old flame, make choices, and unlock different endings with:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runa:</strong> An innocent artist and his first love. A single misunderstanding led to their breakup.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri:</strong> The girl next door who gave Jun-Ho unconditional love. Unfortunately, she always viewed him as a brother.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hana:</strong> Jun-Ho\u2019s colleague and secret office romance. Ambition and sabotage brought things to an end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rahee: </strong>Dated Jun-Ho both before and after her big break into modeling. A public scandal ended their secret relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiso:</strong> A successful career woman working at the same company as Jun-Ho. Business problems led to their downfall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experience:</strong> Unlike many Full Motion Video (FMV) games, Master of Love is told through a first-person perspective \u2013 unlocking the ultimate K-drama experience.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven:</strong> Make choices in life and love to unlock five unique endings \u2013 each moving in their own way.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6+ hours of playtime:</strong> Immerse yourself in a detailed fantasy indistinguishable from real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Videos: </strong>Get to know the charming actors behind<i> Master of Love.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.poster.avif?t=1728527361\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.webm?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.mp4?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failure at both love and career, Jun-Ho takes a bite of his 33rd birthday cake \u2013 and finds himself transported ten years into the past. This time around, can he get things right with at least one ex-girlfriend? Romance each old flame, make choices, and unlock different endings with:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runa:</strong> An innocent artist and his first love. A single misunderstanding led to their breakup.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri:</strong> The girl next door who gave Jun-Ho unconditional love. Unfortunately, she always viewed him as a brother.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hana:</strong> Jun-Ho\u2019s colleague and secret office romance. Ambition and sabotage brought things to an end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rahee: </strong>Dated Jun-Ho both before and after her big break into modeling. A public scandal ended their secret relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiso:</strong> A successful career woman working at the same company as Jun-Ho. Business problems led to their downfall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experience:</strong> Unlike many Full Motion Video (FMV) games, Master of Love is told through a first-person perspective \u2013 unlocking the ultimate K-drama experience.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven:</strong> Make choices in life and love to unlock five unique endings \u2013 each moving in their own way.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6+ hours of playtime:</strong> Immerse yourself in a detailed fantasy indistinguishable from real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Videos: </strong>Get to know the charming actors behind<i> Master of Love.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Single and unemployed, 33-year-old Jun-Ho finds himself transported back in time ten years. He takes the chance to romance five women from his past \u2013 and get it right this time. Unlock five unique endings in Master of Love, an FMV game that offers the ultimate K-drama experience.",
